    {
      "id": "sticky-step5",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Handle known intents\n\nEach intent demonstrates a different Zalo Bot operation: `sendMessage` for menu and pricing, `sendPhoto` for product showcase, and escalation logging with acknowledgment.",
